        "is_free": true,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125230/extras/82b35afceb44f07c4b6155c6f28745e8.avif?t=1759591952\" width=616 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The C.I. Puppet Friends™ star in their first ever full video game: Landon's Puzzle ParTAY™!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hey everyone, It's me Landon! I'm inviting you to my first ever Puzzle ParTAY! (<strong>not</strong> a 'party') </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I just know you'll have lots of tons of fun, so come on down! (chips and dip <strong>not</strong> included)&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Landon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landon's Puzzle ParTAY is a fast-paced, arcade-style, time-attack, puzzle game! This game features various puzzle types with a C.I. Puppet Friends twist! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Put together classic puzzles with Landon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Help Josie cross different terrains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Guide Chef Paisano through the grocery store to find all of the ingredients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Help (paper doll) Landon find the right pose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find hidden secrets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All while being cheered on by your favorite Puppet Friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125230/extras/5b30c09a0e156242497581ea4bfa412b.avif?t=1759591952\" width=616 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll race against the clock to complete all sorts of different puzzles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jigsaw puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mazes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slide puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Problem solving</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crosswords</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patterns</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming challenges as bonus rounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more to come!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle gets more difficult as you complete them. After your first puzzle, each round will have you race through with a completely different pattern. Each puzzle you solve adds <strong>1 point</strong> to your score! How many puzzles can you solve before running out of time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125230/extras/18674980a947ca5b34ad7df78059d899.avif?t=1759591952\" width=616 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others in an online leaderboard to see how many puzzles you can solve! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock special badges with each rank, as you race for the high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create your own profile, with your favorite character as an avatar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(remember, chips and dip are <strong>not</strong> included, stop asking, Elvin)</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125230/extras/82b35afceb44f07c4b6155c6f28745e8.avif?t=1759591952\" width=616 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The C.I. Puppet Friends™ star in their first ever full video game: Landon's Puzzle ParTAY™!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hey everyone, It's me Landon! I'm inviting you to my first ever Puzzle ParTAY! (<strong>not</strong> a 'party') </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I just know you'll have lots of tons of fun, so come on down! (chips and dip <strong>not</strong> included)&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Landon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Landon's Puzzle ParTAY is a fast-paced, arcade-style, time-attack, puzzle game! This game features various puzzle types with a C.I. Puppet Friends twist! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Put together classic puzzles with Landon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Help Josie cross different terrains!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Guide Chef Paisano through the grocery store to find all of the ingredients!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Help (paper doll) Landon find the right pose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Find hidden secrets! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All while being cheered on by your favorite Puppet Friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125230/extras/5b30c09a0e156242497581ea4bfa412b.avif?t=1759591952\" width=616 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you'll race against the clock to complete all sorts of different puzzles! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jigsaw puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mazes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slide puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Problem solving</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crosswords</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Patterns</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Platforming challenges as bonus rounds</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And more to come!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each puzzle gets more difficult as you complete them. After your first puzzle, each round will have you race through with a completely different pattern. Each puzzle you solve adds <strong>1 point</strong> to your score! How many puzzles can you solve before running out of time?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125230/extras/18674980a947ca5b34ad7df78059d899.avif?t=1759591952\" width=616 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with others in an online leaderboard to see how many puzzles you can solve! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unlock special badges with each rank, as you race for the high score!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Create your own profile, with your favorite character as an avatar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(remember, chips and dip are <strong>not</strong> included, stop asking, Elvin)</p>",
        "short_description": "Landon's Puzzle ParTAY™ is a game where you complete puzzles as fast as you can without running out of time! Enjoy all of the fun and wacky minigames with a C.I. Puppet Friends™ flair! Create your own profile and compete for the high score!",
